<title>THAILAND: BEC WORLD audited annual profits rise.</title>
<headline>BEC WORLD audited annual profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reviewed consolidated financial results for the year ending 31 December, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				     For 12 months</p>
<p>				     1996	    1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		   9.41	    11.21</p>
<p>    Net			1,806.44	   529.29</p>
<p>NOTES: Company's full name is BEC World Plc. The company is a media company.</p>
